    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The OpenGov Permitting & Licensing API provides programmatic access to Permitting & Licensing data and workflows. With this API, you can integrate with other systems, build custom applications, or automate tasks. \n\nThe API is designed around REST principles, supports JSON:API standards, and exposes resources such as records, inspections, fees, approvals, and user accounts. This documentation covers available endpoints, request and response formats, and error codes, helping developers extend and integrate OpenGov Permitting & Licensing securely and efficiently.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpenGov Permitting & Licensing API\n Email: developers@opengov.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
